1 0 obj<</Author(star_voyager)/CreationDate(D:20261101022107+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Mature, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora & Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Catra & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Mermista/Sea Hawk \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow \(She-Ra\), Bow & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Frosta & Sea Hawk \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra, Glimmer, Bow, Scorpia, Perfuma, Frosta, Sea Hawk, Entrapta, Hordak, Horde Prime, Huntara, Mermista, Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), Captain Beth Kanmore \(o/c\), she's very loosely based on Kayo from He-Man, and by loosely i mean she's a pilot and from the same place as him, Post Season 5, Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence, and by that i mean it takes place after what im assuming is the season 5 finale, also the major character death happens in the first paragraph, this will be about 10 chapters you will get your, Angst, and your, Fluff, basically i just want to see all these characters going on wacky space adventures so i wrote it, and then tried to frame it around canon, what could go wrong, also other he-man characters will probably be mentioned but i will tag that as i go, here are some other tags and then i'll shut up, PTSD, Abuse, Child Abuse, shadow weaver is here what did u expect, Trauma, Alcoholism, Some Drug Use, also its gets VERY violent, F/F, F/M, Multi, Graphic Depictions Of Violence, Major Character Death, Adora/Catra, Perfuma/Scorpia, Perfuma & Huntara, Original Characters, Slow Burn, NEW TAG: im going to ignore the s5 trailer so this is REALLY canon divergent, i'll finish the 10 chap arc by the 15th i promise, Horde Prime Clones \(She-Ra\))/ModDate(D:20261101022107+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(SPOP: Liberators of the Universe)>>
endobj
