<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SPOP: Liberators of the Universe</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The fight for Etheria is finally over. But just as soon as the Rebellion is settled, Captain Beth Kanmore lands or rather crashes into Bright Moon with an opportunity to bring down the entire Horde once and for all. Acting as their guide, Kanmore and her new crew must traverse the war torn galaxy to have any chance at finally reaching peace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;NOTE: This AU takes place immediately after what I assume will happen in the season 5 finale.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>star_voyager</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista/Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Bow &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Frosta &amp; Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Frosta</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sea Hawk</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Huntara</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Captain Beth Kanmore (o/c)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>she's very loosely based on Kayo from He-Man</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and by loosely i mean she's a pilot and from the same place as him</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post Season 5</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and by that i mean it takes place after what im assuming is the season 5 finale</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also the major character death happens in the first paragraph</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>this will be about 10 chapters you will get your</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and your</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>basically i just want to see all these characters going on wacky space adventures so i wrote it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and then tried to frame it around canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>what could go wrong</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also other he-man characters will probably be mentioned but i will tag that as i go</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>here are some other tags and then i'll shut up</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>PTSD</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Child Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>shadow weaver is here what did u expect</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Trauma</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alcoholism</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Some Drug Use</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also its gets VERY violent</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Multi</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Major Character Death</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma/Scorpia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma &amp; Huntara</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Characters</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Slow Burn</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>NEW TAG: im going to ignore the s5 trailer so this is REALLY canon divergent</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i'll finish the 10 chap arc by the 15th i promise</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime Clones (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:subject>
